# Keep the Docker build context small: service images build from source inside
# the multi-stage builder, so local build outputs are never needed in the context.
**/target/
.git/
.idea/
.vscode/
.github/
*.log
.claude/

# Frontend build artifacts/deps — ui/node_modules alone is ~270MB and was
# being re-sent as build context on every one of the 9 service builds when
# this was a blanket `ui/` exclude. Phase 13 added ui/Dockerfile, which does
# need ui/ sources in context, so only the generated/installed directories
# are excluded now, not the whole tree.
ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/

# Docs and logs — not needed inside any image.
logs/
docs/
architecture/
*.md
